		"1.20.1-2.1.38":"- Fix crash when Patchouli is not around. Closes ER #116\r\n- Bumped version to 2.1.38"
		,
        "1.20.1-2.1.39":"- Completed move to wide energy storage\r\n- Bumped version to 2.1.39"
		,
        "1.20.1-2.1.40":"- Removed requirement for multiblock part types to be an enum\r\n-Bumped version to 2.1.40"
		,
        "1.20.1-2.1.41":"- Added IMultiblockPart#evalOnControllerOrGet(): Supplier-based version of evalOnController()\r\n- Bumped version to 2.1.41"
		,
        "1.20.1-2.1.42":"- Fix buckets not rendering the fluid colour\r\n- Bumped version to 2.1.42"
		,
        "1.20.1-2.1.43":"- Reworked internal code for common machines/containers/screens\r\n- Backported service compat support from 1.20.6\r\n- GUI: new data binding system\r\n- GUI: the debug hover frame now display the control position and size if shilt is held pressed\r\n- GUI: AnchoredLayoutEngine now center horizontally controls with a Top or Bottom layout hint\r\n- GUI: VerticalLayoutEngine and HorizontalLayoutEngine now honor the vertical / horizontal aligment setting of the layout engine\r\n- GUI: added HelpButton variant to show JEI recipes\r\n- Added FluidTankRenderer\r\n- Added MeteredWideEnergyBuffer\r\n- Updated SI prefixes\r\n- Bumped version to 2.1.43"
		,
        "1.20.1-2.1.44":"- Added variants support to BlockVariantsMod\r\n- Bumped version to 2.1.44"
		,
        "1.20.1-2.1.45":"- Forge only init capabilities for BucketItem so let's init them ourself. Closes ER #160\r\n- Bumped version 2.1.45"
		,
        "1.20.1-2.1.46":"- Reset shader colour after paint a solid rect / triangle. Closes ER #172\r\n- Bumped version to 2.1.46"
		,
        "1.20.1-2.1.47":"- (Neo)Forge has an issue where it provides incorrect, empty ModelData when fall damage particles are requested for ModelData-aware blocks (see https://github.com/neoforged/NeoForge/issues/1629). To address this, a fallback ModelData option has been added, which will be used in cases where the requested ModelData returns empty.\r\n- Bumped version to 2.1.47"
		,
        "1.20.1-2.1.48":"- Stop multiblocks from keeping chunks loaded more then necessary\r\n- Bumped version to 2.1.48"
    },
