		"1.21.1-2.4.2":"- Updated Minecraft to version 1.21.1\r\n- Updated NeoForge to version 21.1.22\r\n- Updated CC:Tweaked to version 1.113.0\r\n- Updated JEI to version 19.9.0.122\r\n- Bumped version to 2.4.2"
